AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::removeSupply()
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert with IsPaused for PAUSE_TYPE
├── when market is frozen but not paused
│   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketUnsupportedOperation
└── when market is active
    ├── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketUnsupportedOperation for every input
    ├── it should not accrue interest
    ├── it should not transfer borrow tokens
    └── it should not change market or position accounting
